				<p class="desc_trig_outter"><a data-gmtrig="1" data-exlk="0" style="border-color: #5ee7ff;" id="evc_17890596003467" class="hasFtIMG desc_trig sin_val evcal_list_a" data-ux_val="1"  ><span class='ev_ftImg' data-img='https://depaulusa.org/wp-content/uploads/Sep10_banner-scaled.jpg' data-thumb='https://depaulusa.org/wp-content/uploads/Sep10_banner-300x240.jpg' style='background-image:url("https://depaulusa.org/wp-content/uploads/Sep10_banner-300x240.jpg")'></span><span class='evcal_cblock ' data-bgcolor='#5ee7ff' data-smon='september' data-syr='2026'><span class='evo_start '><em class='day'>thu</em><em class='date'>10</em><em class='month'>sep</em><em class='time'>5:00 pm</em></span><span class='evo_end only_time'><em class='time'>8:30 pm</em></span><em class='clear'></em></span><span class='evcal_desc evo_info '  data-location_address="2324 N Fremont Street" data-location_type="address" data-location_name="Courtelyou Commons" data-location_url="https://depaulusa.org/event-location/courtelyou-commons/" data-location_status="true" ><span class='evo_above_title'></span><span class='evcal_desc2 evcal_event_title' itemprop='name'>Depaul USA Chicago presents, The 9th Annual Dax Gala: Unlocking the Future</span><span class='evo_below_title'></span><span class='evcal_desc_info' ><em class='evcal_time'>5:00 pm - 8:30 pm</em> <em class="evcal_location"  data-add_str="2324 N Fremont Street"><em class="event_location_name">Courtelyou Commons</em>, 2324 N Fremont Street</em></span><span class='evcal_desc3'></span></span><em class='clear'></em></a></p><div class='event_description evcal_eventcard ' style="display:none"><div class='evo_metarow_directimg'><img class='evo_event_main_img' src='https://depaulusa.org/wp-content/uploads/Sep10_banner-scaled.jpg' /></div><div class='evo_metarow_details evorow evcal_evdata_row bordb evcal_event_details'>
							<div class="event_excerpt" style="display:none"><h3 class="padb5 evo_h3">Event Details</h3><p>The Dax Gala is a fundraising event that helps us serve homeless college students from partner colleges and universities. The Dax Program provides housing, case management, counseling, transportation, food and</p></div><span class='evcal_evdata_icons'><i class='fa fa-align-justify'></i></span>
							
							<div class='evcal_evdata_cell '><div class='eventon_full_description'>
									<h3 class='padb5 evo_h3'><span class='evcal_evdata_icons'><i class='fa fa-align-justify'></i></span>Event Details</h3><div class='eventon_desc_in' itemprop='description'>
									<p>The Dax Gala is a fundraising event that helps us serve homeless college students from partner colleges and universities. The Dax Program provides housing, case management, counseling, transportation, food and book stipends, and educational reimbursements to homeless or housing insecure students. Unlocking the Future is a gala raising funds to help with the various costs associated with the program throughout the year.</p>
</div><div class='clear'></div>
